    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14908\">PR #14908</a> from <code>xia-chao:feat/serve-h2c-nodep</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>i think this is worth filling in, because serve only speaks HTTP/1.1 today and h2c clients like grpc just get nothing back.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
