    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> dicej created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14908#discussion_r4391239254\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Would it make sense to use the <code>hyper_util::server::conn::auto::Builder</code> for both cases, conditionally calling <code>Builder::http1_only</code> in the debug case?  Seems like that would reduce duplication a bit.</p>\n</blockquote>",
